WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Biomedical tables contain measurements, but their columns have no meaningful geometry. Reordering columns changes the picture, not the biology.

2
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Dynomap learns which measurements to amplify or suppress. Feature identity is preserved.

3
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Prediction error moves every feature through a continuous two-dimensional space. Task-relevant neighborhoods emerge during training.

4
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Gated values are painted with differentiable Gaussian kernels. One shared topology; a different map for every sample.

5
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:12.000
A vision branch detects local patterns in the rendered map. The image and gated-vector branches are optimized together.

6
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:28.000
The prediction returns to named source features on the learned topology. Integrated Gradients in the manuscript; Gradient SHAP in the web analysis.

7
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:46.000
High discrimination across liquid-biopsy cohorts and RNA carriers. Inspect 59 saved analyses or retrain Dynomap on your table.
